deInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "Pass\u00e9 ce d\u00e9lai, 1 nuit factur\u00e9e.\",\n  \"animaux\": \"Accept\u00e9s avec suppl\u00e9ment de 25\u20ac/nuit (chiens < 10kg uniquement)\",\n  \"parking\": \"Parking priv\u00e9 : 30\u20ac/jour (r\u00e9servation conseill\u00e9e)\",\n  \"wifi\": \"Gratuit dans tout l'h\u00f4tel (fibre optique)\",\n  \"langues_parlees\": [\"Fran\u00e7ais\", \"Anglais\", \"Espagnol\", \"Allemand\"],\n  \"services\": [\n    \"R\u00e9ception 24h/24\",\n    \"Room service 7h-23h\",\n    \"Conciergerie\",\n    \"Bagagerie gratuite\",\n    \"Pressing (24h)\",\n    \"Salle de sport\",\n    \"Spa & sauna\",\n    \"Piscine int\u00e9rieure chauff\u00e9e\"\n  ],\n  \"restauration\": {\n    \"restaurant\": \"Le Lumi\u00e8re\",\n    \"type\": \"Cuisine fran\u00e7aise raffin\u00e9e\",\n    \"horaires\": \"12h-14h30 et 19h-22h30\",\n    \"petit_dejeuner\": \"Buffet continental : 7h-10h30 (25\u20ac/pers)\"\n  },\n  \"chambres\": {\n    \"total\": 85,\n    \"types\": [\n      {\"nom\": \"Classique\", \"superficie\": \"20m\u00b2\", \"prix\": 180},\n      {\"nom\": \"Sup\u00e9rieure\", \"superficie\": \"28m\u00b2\", \"prix\": 250},\n      {\"nom\": \"Deluxe\", \"superficie\": \"35m\u00b2\", \"prix\": 320},\n      {\"nom\": \"Suite Junior\", \"superficie\": \"45m\u00b2\", \"prix\": 450}\n    ]\n  }\n}", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 316, "end_char_idx": 1354, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "88bfc368-09dc-4fd9-baf6-297d8d3cf58f": {"__data__": {"id_": "88bfc368-09dc-4fd9-baf6-297d8d3cf58f", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/christ/Downloads/Telegram Desktop/M1/M1 Avignon universite/Ams projet/ams/robot_hotel/docs/plan_hotel.txt", "file_name": "plan_hotel.txt", "file_type": "text/plain", "file_size": 969, "creation_date": "2025-12-23", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "ec1f4cf9-d9af-4cc8-9b7a-9dc88cb29a20", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/christ/Downloads/Telegram Desktop/M1/M1 Avignon universite/Ams projet/ams/robot_hotel/docs/plan_hotel.txt", "file_name": "plan_hotel.txt", "file_type": "text/plain", "file_size": 969, "creation_date": "2025-12-23", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-23"}, "hash": "578cdac9d8a8098c874793ecc4a140fe3142a439a81d0f703588b715b94f49be", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "PLAN DE L'H\u00d4TEL LUMI\u00c8RE PARIS\n\nR\u00c9CEPTION & ACCUEIL\n- Rez-de-chauss\u00e9e, entr\u00e9e principale\n- \u00c0 droite : conciergerie et bagagerie\n- \u00c0 gauche : ascenseurs centraux\n\nRESTAURANT \"LE LUMI\u00c8RE\"\n- Rez-de-chauss\u00e9e, fond du hall\n- Acc\u00e8s direct depuis la r\u00e9ception\n- Terrasse ext\u00e9rieure (20 places)\n\nBAR & SALON\n- Rez-de-chauss\u00e9e, \u00e0 gauche du restaurant\n- Ouvert jusqu'\u00e0 minuit\n\nPISCINE & SPA\n- 3\u00e8me \u00e9tage\n- Acc\u00e8s par ascenseur central\n- Prendre le couloir \u00e0 gauche en sortant\n- Vestiaires au fond \u00e0 droite\n\nSALLE DE SPORT\n- 3\u00e8me \u00e9tage, \u00e0 c\u00f4t\u00e9 du spa\n- \u00c9quip\u00e9e : tapis, v\u00e9los, poids, TRX\n\nCHAMBRES\n- \u00c9tages 1 \u00e0 5\n- Chambres 101-120 : vue rue (c\u00f4t\u00e9 impair)\n- Chambres 121-185 : vue cour int\u00e9rieure (c\u00f4t\u00e9 pair)\n- Suites : 501 \u00e0 505 (5\u00e8me \u00e9tage)\n\nASCENSEURS\n- 2 ascenseurs centraux (acc\u00e8s tous \u00e9tages)\n- 1 monte-charge (service uniquement)\n\nPARKING\n- Sous-sol -1\n- Entr\u00e9e par rampe lat\u00e9rale gauche\n- Places r\u00e9serv\u00e9es PMR pr\u00e8s de l'ascenseur", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 924, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}, "4391669b-f211-4f21-b304-fae85024bba6": {"__data__": {"id_": "4391669b-f211-4f21-b304-fae85024bba6", "embedding": null, "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/christ/Downloads/Telegram Desktop/M1/M1 Avignon universite/Ams projet/ams/robot_hotel/docs/reglement_piscine.txt", "file_name": "reglement_piscine.txt", "file_type": "text/plain", "file_size": 722, "creation_date": "2025-12-23", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-23"}, "excluded_embed_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "excluded_llm_metadata_keys": ["file_name", "file_type", "file_size", "creation_date", "last_modified_date", "last_accessed_date"], "relationships": {"1": {"node_id": "0f342897-c904-4071-a4f5-c7f4e9b8ecbc", "node_type": "4", "metadata": {"file_path": "/home/christ/Downloads/Telegram Desktop/M1/M1 Avignon universite/Ams projet/ams/robot_hotel/docs/reglement_piscine.txt", "file_name": "reglement_piscine.txt", "file_type": "text/plain", "file_size": 722, "creation_date": "2025-12-23", "last_modified_date": "2025-12-23"}, "hash": "e2f8e71d7d78f7b312fa2096ef9a0a8f8729069fd049980e9a74889fcb2c332e", "class_name": "RelatedNodeInfo"}}, "metadata_template": "{key}: {value}", "metadata_separator": "\n", "text": "R\u00c8GLEMENT DE LA PISCINE INT\u00c9RIEURE\n\nHoraires d'ouverture :\n- Lundi au vendredi : 7h00 - 22h00\n- Samedi et dimanche : 8h00 - 21h00\n\nAcc\u00e8s :\n- R\u00e9serv\u00e9 aux clients de l'h\u00f4tel\n- Enfants < 12 ans accompagn\u00e9s d'un adulte\n- Serviette fournie \u00e0 la r\u00e9ception\n\nR\u00e8gles de s\u00e9curit\u00e9 :\n- Douche obligatoire avant baignade\n- Maillot de bain obligatoire (shorts interdits)\n- Bonnet de bain recommand\u00e9\n- Pas de plong\u00e9e ni de course autour du bassin\n- Pas de nourriture ni de verre\n- Surveillance par ma\u00eetre-nageur de 9h \u00e0 19h\n\n\u00c9quipements :\n- Piscine chauff\u00e9e \u00e0 28\u00b0C\n- Profondeur : 1,20m \u00e0 1,80m\n- Jacuzzi (4 places)\n- Vestiaires avec casiers (code personnel)\n\nEn cas de probl\u00e8me : contacter la r\u00e9ception au poste 0.", "mimetype": "text/plain", "start_char_idx": 0, "end_char_idx": 699, "metadata_seperator": "\n", "text_template": "{metadata_str}\n\n{content}", "class_name": "TextNode"}, "__type__": "1"}}}